ction-system</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in A\">\\(a,b\\in A\\)</span>；有限步闭包见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9ddd157960e9574a\" href=\"?note=9ddd157960e9574a\" title=\"56-df-relation-closure\">56-df-relation-closure</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Join}(A,\\to,a,b)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists c\\in A\\;(a\\to^*c\\land b\\to^*c).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Join}(A,\\to,a,b)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists c\\in A\\;(a\\to^*c\\land b\\to^*c).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>可汇合要求共同后继，而可转换性允许任意有限正反向链；二者仅在额外合流条件下等价。</p>\n<p>来源定位中的 <code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 指本地提取文本的页块序号，不宣称是DjVu物理页码；印刷页已按该页页眉或页脚核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-relation-closure","status":"resolved","id":"9ddd157960e9574a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-relation-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-abstract-reduction-system","status":"resolved","id":"89129816153530db","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-abstract-reduction-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-abstract-reduction-system","status":"resolved","id":"89129816153530db","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A$ 为集合，$\\to\\subseteq A\\times A$；单关系抽象归约系统见 [[56-df-abstract-reduction-system]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-relation-closure","status":"resolved","id":"9ddd157960e9574a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$a,b\\in A$；有限步闭包见 [[56-df-relation-closure]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\to\\subseteq A\\times A","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Join}(A,\\to,a,b)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists c\\in A\\;(a\\to^*c\\land b\\to^*c).","display":true}],"bytes":1080,"backlinks":[{"id":"45e20be1a6b32031","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\leftrightarrow^*$ 见 [[56-df-relation-closure]]，$\\mathrm{Join}$ 见 [[56-df-joinable]]。"},{"id":"875e72f69ea30655","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T$ 为集合，$X\\subseteq T^2$，$s,t\\in T$，$m\\in\\{0,1,2\\}$。$X^*$、$X^{-1}$ 见 [[56-df-relation-closure]]，$\\mathrm{Join}(T,X,s,t)$ 见 [[56-df-joinable]]。本节点引入谓词符号 $\\mathrm{CSat}_{T,m}(X,s,t)$，其定义在Assertion中给出。模式 $0,1,2$ 分别编码转换条件、可汇合条件、定向有限归约条件；模式2本身不包含对右侧目标的正规形要求。"},{"id":"c74959a8cb14eaa5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Join}$ 及 $\\to^*$ 见 [[56-df-joinable]]。"},{"id":"766a1d5bf25248d1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Join}$ 见 [[56-df-joinable]]。"},{"id":"36586b91fb39cf3d","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"工作于ZFC；局部合流、合流、正规形、可汇合与闭包见 [[56-df-locally-confluent]]、[[56-df-confluent]]、[[56-df-normal-form]]、[[56-df-joinable]]、[[56-df-relation-closure]]。"},{"id":"f87aa675097602ab","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-33","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-joinable.md]]"},{"id":"dcc1e9c43059f569","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"CP、局部合流、可汇合见 [[56-df-critical-pair]]、[[56-df-locally-confluent]]、[[56-df-joinable]]。"},{"id":"e6a39a4f73051784","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"SN、合流、CP、Join见 [[56-df-strongly-normalizing]]、[[56-df-confluent]]、[[56-df-crit